47f202aa.mp3","entryId":"58271","definition":"和亲近的人切断关系。","pronunciation":["헤어지다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示说这样那样的话。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示说这样那样的话。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e1977eb9f05bf8c0c1f9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55811-2-7-2","ko":"응, 그 말을 들으니 한동안 멍하게 있을 수 밖에 없었다.","zh":"嗯，听见那句话后，我愣了好一阵。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"말을","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말을","audio":"/audio/e897e0419e4ab64902fd.mp3"}},{"text":"들으니","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들으니","audio":"/audio/ef71319629dc92fce6c7.mp3"}},{"text":"한동안","meaning":"一度，一时，一阵子，长时间","explanation":"한동안：一度，一时，一阵子，长时间","readings":[{"term":"한동안","audio":"/audio/9efbe5bbba69a9d59231.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72432","senseId":"1","lemma":"한동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한동안","audio":"/audio/9efbe5bbba69a9d59231.mp3"}},{"text":"멍하게","meaning":"发懵，恍惚","explanation":"멍하다：发懵，恍惚；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"멍하다","audio":"/audio/eaef63f85bb60c65b575.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55811","senseId":"2","lemma":"멍하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멍하게","audio":"/audio/15af1d3d39dcbde37efe.mp3"}},{"text":"있을","meaning":"处于，处在","explanation":"있다：处于，处在；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68796","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을","audio":"/audio/e77f5d4b360ff618b52e.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"밖에","meaning":"밖에：与否定表达合用，表示“只有、除……之外没有”。","explanation":"밖에：与否定表达合用，表示“只有、除……之外没有”。","readings":[{"term":"밖에","audio":"/audio/b49faf879a59fe63a605.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖에","audio":"/audio/b49faf879a59fe63a605.mp3"}},{"text":"없었다.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없었다","audio":"/audio/ba33dc59ec41749a6db8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想